@GreenCart.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5126

GET {{GreenCart.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{GreenCart.Api_HostAddress}}/api/products?isDeal=true&inStock=true
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{GreenCart.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

